{"term": {"label": "智", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "6A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/gaozi-i", "title": "告子上", "description": "告子曰：「性，猶杞柳也；義，猶桮棬也。以人性為仁義，猶以杞柳為桮棬。」\n孟子曰：「子能順杞柳之性而以為桮棬乎？將戕賊杞柳而後以為桮棬也？如將戕賊杞柳而以為桮棬，則亦將戕賊人以為仁義與？率天下之人而禍仁義者，必子之言夫！」\n告子曰：「性猶湍水也，決諸東方則東流，決諸西方則西流。人性之無分於善不善也，猶水之無分於東西也。」", "occurrences": 4, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "信", "id": "信"}, {"form": "內", "id": "內"}, {"form": "受", "id": "受"}, {"form": "外", "id": "外"}, {"form": "從", "id": "從"}, {"form": "心", "id": "心"}, {"form": "智", "id": "智"}, {"form": "火", "id": "火"}, {"form": "炙", "id": "炙"}, {"form": "熟", "id": "熟"}, {"form": "白", "id": "白"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "耆", "id": "耆"}, {"form": "飲食", "id": "飲食"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.580216829592325, "source": "熟", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.3978952727983707, "source": "飲食", "target": "外"}, {"weight": 1.6639260977181702, "source": "內", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.8870696490323797, "source": "內", "target": "外"}, {"weight": 1.4275373196539396, "source": "內", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 1.4170660197866443, "source": "白", "target": "外"}, {"weight": 1.599387576580599, "source": "白", "target": "從"}, {"weight": 1.7152193921057206, "source": "仁", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 1.4816045409242156, "source": "仁", "target": "外"}, {"weight": 0.5877866649021191, "source": "仁", "target": "心"}, {"weight": 1.8870696490323797, "source": "仁", "target": "智"}, {"weight": 1.4816045409242156, "source": "仁", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 2.580216829592325, "source": "仁", "target": "信"}, {"weight": 2.174751721484161, "source": "仁", "target": "火"}, {"weight": 3.3423568816392217, "source": "炙", "target": "耆"}, {"weight": 2.3978952727983707, "source": "炙", "target": "外"}, {"weight": 1.8870696490323797, "source": "從", "target": "外"}, {"weight": 1.0986122886681098, "source": "禮", "target": "心"}, {"weight": 2.3978952727983707, "source": "禮", 